# RR Core (Project)

- If the task changes more than 2 files, write a short plan BEFORE coding.
- Keep changes small and clear (one concern at a time).
- Never paste or commit secrets (keys/tokens/passwords).
- After changes, run lint/tests (or clearly say what you ran).
- If unsure, ask a question before guessing.



